Subject: [PATCH 22/28] README: images, the pull secret, and the release
 branches

The GHCR packages are private, inheriting the repositories' visibility, so a
cluster needs a pull secret and --run-namespace to use them. Documented
rather than worked around, with the option of making the package public
noted along with what that publishes.

